{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Spotreba pitnej vody","update":"2026-09-07","note":"\u00dadaje od roku 2013 - 2020 boli upraven\u00e9 z d\u00f4vodu upresnenia.\nObce so z\u00e1pornou spotrebou vody s\u00fa tzv. dohadn\u00e9 polo\u017eky.\nSpotreba pitnej vody - spolu (v tis. m3) - je to mno\u017estvo fakturovanej pitnej vody predanej priamym odberate\u013eom. Ak je osaden\u00fd vodomer, meria sa odpo\u010dtom vodomeru, ak nie je, ur\u010d\u00ed sa mno\u017estvo fakturovanej vody pau\u0161\u00e1lnou \u010diastkou za predpokladan\u00e9 mno\u017estvo odobranej vody pod\u013ea smern\u00fdch spotrebn\u00fdch \u010d\u00edsiel.\nSpotreba pitnej vody - pre dom\u00e1cnosti (v tis. m3) - je to mno\u017estvo pitnej vody  spotrebovanej obyvate\u013estvom.\nZdroj \u00fadajov:\nV\u00fdskumn\u00fd \u00fastav vodn\u00e9ho hospod\u00e1rstva\n....\n","href":"http:\/\/datacube.statistics.sk\/#!\/view\/sk\/VBD_SK_WIN\/vh5003rr\/v_vh5003rr_00_00_00_sk","id":["nuts15","vh5003rr_rok","vh5003rr_ukaz","vh5003rr_data"],"size":[1,30,1,1],"role":{"time":["vh5003rr_rok"],"geo":["nuts15"],"metric":["vh5003rr_data"]},"dimension":{"nuts15":{"label":"nuts15","note":"0 SR + Oblasti + Kraje + Okresy + Obce","category":{"index":{"SK0321508438":0},"label":{"SK0321508438":"Bansk\u00e1 Bystrica"}}},"vh5003rr_rok":{"label":"vh5003rr_rok","note":"Rok","category":{"index":{"2025":0,"2024":1,"2023":2,"2022":3,"2021":4,"2020":5,"2019":6,"2018":7,"2017":8,"2016":9,"2015":10,"2014":11,"2013":12,"2012":13,"2011":14,"2010":15,"2009":16,"2008":17,"2007":18,"2006":19,"2005":20,"2004":21,"2003":22,"2002":23,"2001":24,"2000":25,"1999":26,"1998":27,"1997":28,"1996":29}}},"vh5003rr_ukaz":{"label":"vh5003rr_ukaz","note":"Ukazovate\u013e","category":{"index":{"U03084":0},"label":{"U03084":"Spotreba pitnej vody - spolu"}}},"vh5003rr_data":{"label":"vh5003rr_data","note":"Data","category":{"index":{"NUM_VALUE":0},"label":{"NUM_VALUE":"hodnota"}}}},"value":[4053,4046,3868,3991,4046,3958,4064,4242,4079,4037,4210,